{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":2,"ref":"judges 20:2","book":"judges","lang":"de","chapter":20,"translation":"Und die Spitzenleute stellten sich auf, ⟨das ist⟩ alle Stämme Jisraels — die gesamten Winkel des ganzen Volkes — in der Versammlung ⟨des⟩ Volkes ⟨der⟩ Elohim: vierhunderttausend Mann zu Fuß, Schwerter ziehend.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויתיצבו","gloss":"und es stellten sich auf"},{"surface":"פנות","gloss":"die Spitzenleute \/ Winkel"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"alle"},{"surface":"העם","gloss":"(des) Volkes"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"(die) gesamten"},{"surface":"שבטי","gloss":"Stämme"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Jisraels"},{"surface":"בקהל","gloss":"in der Versammlung"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"(des) Volkes"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"ארבע","gloss":"vier"},{"surface":"מאות","gloss":"hundert"},{"surface":"אלף","gloss":"tausend"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"Mann"},{"surface":"רגלי","gloss":"zu Fuß"},{"surface":"שלף","gloss":"ziehend"},{"surface":"חרב","gloss":"(die) Schwerter"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T08:36:11.878087812Z","model":"glm-5.2"}